# Offload development to Google Jules

Ajinkya has Jules credits and wants to **save Cursor credits**.

**Hand to Jules (default for build work):**
- App scaffolding, UI, GitHub Pages / static frontends
- Productionization PRs, refactors Jules already started
- Feature wiring that can be specified as a clear PR task
- Follow-ups on Jules PRs (implement review feedback via Jules when practical)

**Keep in Cursor:**
- Reviewing Jules PRs and deciding merge/stand-up
- Architecture / accuracy / model-stack judgment
- Work that needs the Wednesday volume (field photos, `models/hf_cache/`, local BioCLIP runs)
- Anything Gemini/Jules cannot access on that volume

When the user asks to build something development-shaped, prefer drafting a precise Jules task / using the existing Jules PR over re-implementing the whole thing here.
